{{define "tidy"}}<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
{{template "head" .}}
<body data-prefix="{{.Prefix}}" data-view="tidy">
{{template "top" .}}
<main class="grid settings">
<section class="left set-left">
<div class="crumb"><a href="/p/{{.Prefix}}">← {{.Prefix}}</a></div>
<h1>Tidy</h1>
<p class="note">What could go: worktrees whose PR is merged or closed, or whose stack has been stopped over {{.Days}} days, and images no stack uses. Each is checked again when it is removed. Only a clean worktree whose PR is done, and an unused image, start ticked; one that is only idle, or dirty (uncommitted changes), you tick yourself.</p>
{{if .Error}}<p class="red set-error">{{.Error}}</p>
{{end}}{{if .Warnings}}<div class="warnings">{{range .Warnings}}<p class="yellow">{{.}}</p>
{{end}}</div>
{{end}}<section class="card">
<h2>Candidates <span class="muted">{{.Total}}</span></h2>
<form method="post" action="{{.URL}}" data-job="tidy">
<table class="set-table">
<thead><tr><th></th><th>Item</th><th>Why</th><th>Size</th><th></th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{{range .Items}}<tr><td><input type="checkbox" name="{{if .Dirty}}dirty{{else}}id{{end}}" value="{{.ID}}"{{if .Ticked}} checked{{end}} aria-label="Remove {{.Name}}"></td><td class="mono">{{if eq .Kind "worktree"}}{{.Name}}{{if .Branch}} <span class="muted">{{.Branch}}</span>{{end}}{{else}}{{.Name}}{{end}}</td><td>{{.Why}}{{if .Idle}} <span class="muted">{{.Idle}}</span>{{end}}</td><td class="mono size">{{.Size}}</td><td>{{if .Dirty}}<span class="chip yellow" title="Uncommitted changes or untracked files">dirty</span>{{end}}</td></tr>
{{else}}<tr><td colspan="5" class="muted">Nothing to tidy.</td></tr>
{{end}}</tbody>
</table>
{{if .Items}}<label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="confirm" value="1"> Discard their changes: a dirty worktree I tick goes with its uncommitted work and its nvim and agent homes</label>
<button class="ln danger">Remove selected</button>
{{end}}</form>
<p class="note">A worktree goes as <code>wt rm</code> removes it (its containers, volumes and checkout; the branch stays in git); an image as <code>podman rmi &lt;name&gt;</code>.</p>
</section>
</section>
<section class="pane">
{{template "jobs" .Jobs}}
</section>
</main>
{{template "common-dialogs" .}}
</body>
</html>
{{end}}
